# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Scrap Trove — Mobile App  (env template)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW TO USE
#   1. Copy this file to `.env.local` (git ignores it) for `npx expo start`.
#   2. For EAS cloud APK builds, env vars are baked in at build time
#      via `eas.json` per-profile `env` blocks — NOT this file.
#   3. Only variables prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ are exposed to the app bundle.
#
# Convention: THIS repo uses .env.local as the ONLY per-machine env
# file. `eas.json` handles per-build-profile injection separately.

# API base URL that the mobile app talks to.
#   Local expo dev:      https://api.stage.scraptrove.com  (staging by default)
#   Staging APK build:   set in eas.json → build.preview.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
#   Production APK build: set in eas.json → build.production.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.stage.scraptrove.com

# ── CI / EAS credentials — never in this file, never committed ─────────
# EXPO_TOKEN goes into GitHub Actions repository secrets, not here.
